    "paragraph": "Researchers developed the NeuroDesign/NeuroArchitecture Index (NDIX) to measure six experiential dimensions of the built environment, including naturalness, sensory, emotional, and safety factors. DySENSE introduced a multimodal generative framework that synthesizes static urban satellite imagery with spatially aligned, monthly dynamic building energy consumption maps. Additionally, a new deep learning framework processes Mapillary street-level imagery using monocular metric depth estimation and 3D point cloud reconstruction to compute wheelchair accessibility metrics for sidewalk infrastructure.",
